LifeOS database migrations
==========================

This repository starts with an empty baseline revision because the current
SQL Server database already contains the existing LifeOS schema.

For the EXISTING development database, run once:

    python -m flask --app app db stamp 20260726_0001

This records the current schema without creating, dropping, or changing any
existing tables.

Verify the recorded revision with:

    python -m flask --app app db current

Future schema changes must be created through reviewed migration revisions:

    python -m flask --app app db migrate -m "describe the change"
    python -m flask --app app db upgrade

Never run `db stamp` on a new empty production database as a replacement for
actual schema creation.
